====== TP-Link CPE210/CPE220 ======
TP-Link CPE210/220 is a 2.4Ghz outdoor access point similar to [[toh:ubiquiti:nanostationm2|Ubiquiti NanoStations]]. There is also a 5GHz Version of this AP, the [[toh:tp-link:cpe510|TP-Link CPE510/520]]. The device has a built-in 9dBi 2x2 dual-polarized directional MIMO antenna with a beamwidth of 65° (H-Plane) and 35° (E-Plane).

{{media:tplink:cpe210.png|TP-Link CPE210}}

